  "sourceAssignment": "Completion 155 Turn the Corner exclusively uses eleven original turn-the-corner-part1..11 families in chronology. Full disjoint original windows include entry, LEVEL IS SINK destruction and undo, the extra-rock preparation, shared-rule construction, one wall sacrifice and LEVEL IS WIN victory. All originals and sidecars remain retained.",
  "scope": "LEVEL IS SINK destroyed the playable board and was undone. FLAG IS ROCK created an unused reserve rock. Shared WALL IS OPEN and ROCK IS PUSH AND SHUT let the original rock open wall (343, 256). WIN then passed through that hole, displaced SINK sideways and completed LEVEL IS WIN, triggering victory. Settled map pause confirms 155 / nine flowers.",
